["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ゆっくりと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缓慢；不急不躁；悠闲；从容；（时间上）绰绰有余；充裕；足足；充分；（睡眠等）好好地；舒适地；安稳地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227740\">おじいさんはとてもゆっくりと<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">爷爷说话很慢</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ゆでる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">煮沸；水煮；用药蒸汽熏治</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78488\"><ruby>卵<rp>(</rp><rt>たまご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>硬<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くゆでてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">煮鸡蛋硬。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ゆとり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">余地；回旋余地；余量；裕度；宽裕；充裕的时间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155717\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>新車<rp>(</rp><rt>しんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うゆとりは<ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我买不起新车</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ユニフォーム</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">制服；运动服</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203028\">チームのメンバーは<ruby>道具<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とユニフォームを<ruby>提供<rp>(</rp><rt>ていきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">向小组成员提供了设备和制服。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">輸入</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆにゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">进口；引进；（生物）传入的（神经、血管等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218574\">これはドイツから<ruby>輸入<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆにゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是从德国进口的车</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ユニーク</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">独特的；有独创性的；个性独特的；不寻常的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185285\"><ruby>会社<rp>(</rp><rt>かいしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にパンタロンとアロハシャツを<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てくる<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、かなりユニークな<ruby>存在<rp>(</rp><rt>そんざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是个很特别的人 穿着钟底和夏威夷衬衫去办公室</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">湯飲み</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆのみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">茶杯；茶盏</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185170\"><ruby>壊<rp>(</rp><rt>こわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた<ruby>湯飲<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みの<ruby>補充<rp>(</rp><rt>ほじゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我用新的杯子换了破碎的杯子</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">指</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆび</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">手指；脚趾；趾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201873\">ドアに<ruby>指<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をはさみました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我发现我的手指在门口。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">指差す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆびさす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">用手指指；指点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">指輪</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆびわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">戒指；指环</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221740\">この<ruby>指輪<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆびわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をある<ruby>場所<rp>(</rp><rt>ばしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在某个地方买的戒指</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">弓</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">弓；射箭；箭术；琴弓</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75282\">この<ruby>弓<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>張<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りが<ruby>強<rp>(</rp><rt>つよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个弓有很强的画</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夢</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">梦；梦境；梦；希望；愿望；志向；抱负；不切实际的幻想；白日梦；空想；妄想；幻觉；错觉；转瞬即逝的事物；昙花一现的东西</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233006\">あなたの<ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がみんな<ruby>実現<rp>(</rp><rt>じつげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されますように。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">愿你的梦想成真!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">由来</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆらい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">由来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>地名<rp>(</rp><rt>ちめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>由来<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆらい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>調<rp>(</rp><rt>しら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べてみた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">查了一下这个地名的由来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">揺らぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆらぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">摇晃；摇摆；震动；颤动；摇晃不定；动摇；变得不稳定</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">松的；不紧；宽松的；不严格的；平缓的；和缓的；缓慢的；微弱的；软的；不结实的；（用否定形「ゆるくない」）困难；不容易；费劲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222254\">この<ruby>靴<rp>(</rp><rt>くつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>緩<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这双鞋有点松</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">許す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">允许；准许；同意；批准；原谅；宽恕；饶恕；容忍；豁免；减免；释放；放过；承认；认可；信任；信赖；放松警惕；失分；让出（距离等）；退让</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123041\"><ruby>二度<rp>(</rp><rt>にど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とあなたの<ruby>誤<rp>(</rp><rt>あやま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>許<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しませぬ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我再也不会忽视你的错误了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变松弛；松弛（如绳子）；变得不紧张；放松；放松警惕；（寒冷）缓和；减弱；（监管等）变得松懈；变软（如地面、表情）；（冰）部分融化；减慢；降低（如速度）；（市场价格）小幅下跌</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">松开；放松；放松（注意力、努力等）；松懈（警惕）；消除（紧张感）；放宽（规则）；松动（管制）；放松（限制）；降低（速度）；减速；放慢；使（坡度）变得更平缓</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211508\">その<ruby>規則<rp>(</rp><rt>きそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>最近<rp>(</rp><rt>さいきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>緩<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>められた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">规则最近有所放松。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩やか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるやか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">松的；不紧的；平缓的；缓慢的；宽松的；不严格的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222599\">この<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>規律<rp>(</rp><rt>きりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がやや<ruby>緩<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>やかだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这所学校的纪律相当温和</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">揺れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">摇晃；摇摆；摇动；颤动；抖动；颠簸；摇曳；闪烁；动摇；不稳定；不安定；摇摆不定；犹豫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137399\"><ruby>大地<rp>(</rp><rt>だいち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>揺<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れるのが<ruby>感<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">感觉到地在摇晃。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/3630092\" title=\"Tatoeba · suitchic\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · suitchic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ユーモア</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">幽默；诙谐；笑话</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"118797\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>素晴<rp>(</rp><rt>すば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らしいユーモアのセンスがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他有很强的幽默感。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">世</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">世界；社会；公众；人生；一生；时代；年代；时期；世代；统治；统治时期；世道；时局；存在的世界；生存的世界</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"145130\"><ruby>新聞<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>世<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>動向<rp>(</rp><rt>どうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>左右<rp>(</rp><rt>さゆう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">报纸影响着时间的流逝</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夜明け</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よあけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\